            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "France C"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simple and delicious! I like the addition of the banana. They balance out the tartness from the pineapple and mango. I'm not normally a huge fan of papaya, but it's very good mixed with the other fruits. I think next time I might sprinkle some coconut over the top. Great recipe!\nEdited to add: I would recommend eating this the same day. It tends to get mushy when stored for more than a day."
